   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Peaceful, Credible and Inclusive elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x2018;Fostering Peaceful, Credible and Inclusive Elections in Sierra Leone 2022-2023&#x2019; is a nationwide project implemented by UNDP Sierra Leone. The project aims to support the government of Sierra Leone to conduct peaceful, credible and inclusive elections in 2023. It seeks to enhance the capacity of key institutions such as the Electoral Commission of Sierra Leone (ECSL), the Political Party Registration Commission (PPRC), the Judiciary and the Security Sector.</narrative>
  </description>
